sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Model Owner
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as modelservice-controller-manager<br/>8081/TCP health, 8443/TCP metrics
    participant BaseConfig as BaseConfig ConfigMap

    Note over User,BaseConfig: Flow 1: ModelService Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply ModelService CR<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event (ModelService change)<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET BaseConfig ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: BaseConfig data

    Note over Controller: Template interpolation<br/>+ Semantic merge<br/>(in-memory)

    par Create/Update Child Resources
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Prefill Deployment<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Decode Deployment<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE EPP Deployment + Service<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE InferencePool CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE InferenceModel CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE HTTPRoute CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE ServiceAccounts + RoleBindings<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    end

    Controller->>K8sAPI: PATCH ModelService/status<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>User: ModelService status updated
